            <ArticleTitle>Medial necrosis due to sirolimus-eluting stent implantation in human coronary artery.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>60-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.jjcc.2007.08.001</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report an autopsy case showing medial necrosis at the segment of sirolimus-eluting stent implantation. These findings indicate that cytotoxic effects of sirolimus can induce late-acquired incomplete stent apposition and/or aneurysmal changes after stenting in human coronary arteries.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
